{"3365900": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Oh, Bugger!", "steam_appid": 3365900, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh, Bugger! is a single-player first-person shooter where you take on the role of a mech pilot on a mission to reclaim a luxury hotel overrun by an alien infestation. Set in a retro-futuristic hotel, the game combines intense combat, mech upgrades, and a visually striking environment to deliver a thrilling experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mech Combat:</strong> You are controlling a big mech suit with a massive mini-gun that can transform into a shotgun! With it, you mow down hordes of relentless aliens. Experience adrenaline-fueled action with satisfying gunplay and explosive effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization:</strong> Upgrade the abilities that your mech has. Tailor your playstyle to dominate the battlefield.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro-Futuristic Aesthetic:</strong> Immerse yourself in a visually stunning environment inspired by retro-futuristic sci-fi designs. From the posh lobby of the hotel to the eerie glow of alien nests – every detail enhances the atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Enemy Types:</strong> Face different alien threats, each one with unique behaviors. Strategize your approach to overcome every threat you face!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Mode:</strong> Explore the ship room by room in a new survival mode - face unending waves of aliens and see how long you can last! <strong>Unlock it after completing the campaign.</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Development Team</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed by third-year students at Breda University of Applied Sciences, Oh, Bugger! delivers intense action, strategic mech customization, and a uniquely stylized space environment for an unforgettable gaming experience.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh, Bugger! is a single-player first-person shooter where you take on the role of a mech pilot on a mission to reclaim a luxury hotel overrun by an alien infestation. Set in a retro-futuristic hotel, the game combines intense combat, mech upgrades, and a visually striking environment to deliver a thrilling experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mech Combat:</strong> You are controlling a big mech suit with a massive mini-gun that can transform into a shotgun! With it, you mow down hordes of relentless aliens. Experience adrenaline-fueled action with satisfying gunplay and explosive effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization:</strong> Upgrade the abilities that your mech has. Tailor your playstyle to dominate the battlefield.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro-Futuristic Aesthetic:</strong> Immerse yourself in a visually stunning environment inspired by retro-futuristic sci-fi designs. From the posh lobby of the hotel to the eerie glow of alien nests – every detail enhances the atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Enemy Types:</strong> Face different alien threats, each one with unique behaviors. Strategize your approach to overcome every threat you face!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Mode:</strong> Explore the ship room by room in a new survival mode - face unending waves of aliens and see how long you can last! <strong>Unlock it after completing the campaign.</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Development Team</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed by third-year students at Breda University of Applied Sciences, Oh, Bugger! delivers intense action, 